[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10264.03, "timestamp": "02:51:04", "text": "暂停。等待。所以，呃，我们会改一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10267.83, "timestamp": "02:51:07", "text": "不同。呃，我们会把它改成这样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10268.99, "timestamp": "02:51:08", "text": "嗯，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10272.07, "timestamp": "02:51:12", "text": "一。我的意思是，我不想拼命努力，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10274.75, "timestamp": "02:51:14", "text": "因为我有银胡子，我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10277.63, "timestamp": "02:51:17", "text": "这，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10280.87, "timestamp": "02:51:20", "text": "但是，哦，大家都打败了它。一切就绪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10284.91, "timestamp": "02:51:24", "text": "打败它。我的天啊。好的。呃，频道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10288.75, "timestamp": "02:51:28", "text": "二。我无法收看二频道。它满了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10291.63, "timestamp": "02:51:31", "text": "不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10294.07, "timestamp": "02:51:34", "text": "欢迎。是的，我不需要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10296.309, "timestamp": "02:51:36", "text": "说实话。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10299.429, "timestamp": "02:51:39", "text": "其实不需要厨师。我的意思是，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10302.07, "timestamp": "02:51:42", "text": "我想要这条威风凛凛的项链。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10304.79, "timestamp": "02:51:44", "text": "拥有一条更好的项链和一件更好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10307.83, "timestamp": "02:51:47", "text": "戒指。所以，我得去刷巨型怪了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10312.91, "timestamp": "02:51:52", "text": "但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10319.429, "timestamp": "02:51:59", "text": "秒。另外，我忘了聊天。"}]